INSPIRE Index Polygons
----------------------
Contains HM Land Registry data © Crown copyright and database right.
Contains Ordnance Survey data © Crown copyright and database right.

INSPIRE Index Polygons are published under the Open Government Licence, but
the Open Government Licence does not extend to third-party rights that HM Land
Registry is not authorised to license. HM Land Registry uses Ordnance Survey
data to prepare the polygons, and use of the polygon geometry (including the
x,y coordinates) is subject to Ordnance Survey licensing terms. Satisfy
yourself that your intended use complies before relying on this data
commercially.

INSPIRE polygons are indicative title extents, not legally definitive
boundaries.


