Registered leases; Restrictive covenants
-----------------------------------------------------------------
These datasets are free of charge but are NOT published under the Open
Government Licence. They carry HM Land Registry's own licence terms, which
include restrictions on commercial re-use and on republishing the data
wholesale.

You must register at https://use-land-property-data.service.gov.uk/ and accept
the licence for each dataset before you can download it. This software never
redistributes these datasets: it downloads them using your API key, under the
licence you accepted, to your own machine. Your use of the resulting data
remains governed by that licence.


